				{
					"id": 722710201,
					"content": "關於龍骨花凝珠。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722710202
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722710202,
					"content": "那麼，您考慮的如何了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722710203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳琅"
				},
				{
					"id": 722710203,
					"content": "敝店願意以80000摩拉加5份豐年有餘來收購。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722710204,
						722710207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳琅"
				},
				{
					"id": 722710204,
					"content": "就決定賣給妳了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722710205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722710205,
					"content": "謝謝您的惠顧，這些摩拉請收好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722710206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳琅"
				},
				{
					"id": 722710206,
					"content": "往後要是還有類似的寶貝，小店隨時恭候您的光臨。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "琳琅"
				},
				{
					"id": 722710207,
					"content": "我還要再考慮一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722710208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722710208,
					"content": "嗯，對於這種珍奇寶物，價比三家也是應該的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722710209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳琅"
				},
				{
